# Tooling and Related Dotfiles

This rules contains which tooling and related dotfiles this repository is storing.  A list of tools and their subsequent dotfiles below.

* Ack
  * .ackrc
* Ghostty
  * .config/ghostty/*
* Hyprland
  * .config/hypr/hyprland.conf
  * .config/hypr/conf/*.conf
* Hyprlock
  * .config/hypr/hyprlock.conf
* Hyprpaper
  * .config/hypr/hyprpaper.conf
* Neovim
  * .config/nvim/**/*
* Waybar
  * .config/waybar/config.jsonc
  * .config/waybar/style.css
* Zsh
  * .aliasrc
  * .zshrc
